Error [E0113]: `bad` promises to return Int, but this returns String (text)
  --> tests/ui/module_inline_type_error.jet:2:34
    |
  2 |     pub fn bad() Int -> { return "not a number" }
    |                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the value handed back must match the declared return type
 Fix: use Int here
